{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>בנות</b> — offspring, meaning that HaShem begot them. And likewise <b>בנותיו</b>; <b>והון</b>, its meaning is wealth. Another interpretation: like <b>רב לך הונך</b>. <b>יקהת</b> from <b>יקהת עמים</b>, and its meaning is to bind. If, and the interpretation: there is a generation whose father will curse him and it is fitting to honor him."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:33.583934142Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}